  "_type": "post",
  "_updatedAt": "2026-08-05T06:24:48Z",
  "body": [
    {
      "_key": "e8f5dfb7e15c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "9824abd4f4fd",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "TL;DR:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "b5f09b9963ca",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Sprint planning generates your most valuable product context, the verbal trade-offs, estimation debates, and deprioritization reasoning that never ends up in Jira. Granola runs on your laptop or phone and uses your device's audio to generate notes, so you can facilitate rather than scribe and query the reasoning months later when stakeholders ask \"why didn't we build X?\""
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "blockquote"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c19c6912ace1",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "e4b72e94281c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Jira tracks what your team committed to building. It won't capture the fifteen minutes of debate that produced that commitment, the engineering constraint that pushed SSO to the backlog, or the customer signal that made you prioritize the mobile update over the API redesign."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "272b6004eb91",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "fa85f1c79730",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "That's where your product context disappears. Three sprints later, when a stakeholder asks \"why didn't we build X?\", the honest answer lives in a verbal conversation nobody wrote down. An "
        },
        {
          "_key": "d4931e543579",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "92fdc172726f"
          ],
          "text": "AI notepad "
        },
        {
          "_key": "1681ba790cac",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "solves this by capturing the reasoning behind every sprint decision, turning verbal debates into queryable history."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "92fdc172726f",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.granola.ai/ai-note-taker"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "cd46f541f53a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b6e8cd9e9c9b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The problem with traditional sprint planning documentation"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "19224c998efe",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "5fe3a5fbceb4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Sprint planning generates your most context-rich discussions and produces your least useful written records. Three patterns drive this:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "716dcb7fd2b1",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "f90d04328044",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "The scribe trap:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "57f959fe7581",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " You cannot simultaneously facilitate a negotiation on story points and type verbatim notes. When Engineering pushes back on a five-point estimate and Design argues for keeping a feature in scope, you need to be fully in that conversation. The moment you start typing, you stop facilitating."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "4368f2fbdc35",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "0d6c0317330b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "The \"happy path\" problem:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "11a115c34868",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Manual notes capture the final decision (\"SSO moved to backlog\") but skip the debate that produced it. Three sprints later, that ticket looks like an arbitrary deprioritization rather than a deliberate trade-off."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "8193fd3abc70",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "cab1c03a463b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Context rot:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "1303a0771144",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " You cannot explain a \"5-point estimate\" four months later when the conversation about why it was complex is gone. The engineer who flagged the dependency has moved on. Text-based AI tools can summarize existing tickets or generate drafts from typed input, but they cannot capture the verbal context that never got written down in the first place."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "9e0501747a2d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "72e41201a9bd",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "How an AI notepad prevents decision amnesia"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "70afd81cc160",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "332e9618814e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The most valuable data in a sprint planning meeting is not the sprint goal. It's the reasoning behind what you chose "
        },
        {
          "_key": "e52edb744d7f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "em"
          ],
          "text": "not"
        },
        {
          "_key": "2b1dcf1dfbef",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " to build."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "html0",
      "_type": "rawHtml",
      "html": "<table>\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 40%\" />\n<col style=\"width: 60%\" />\n</colgroup>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>What Jira captures</th>\n<th>What Granola captures</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Sprint goal</td>\n<td>Debate that shaped the goal</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Final story points</td>\n<td>Reasoning behind estimation changes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Status: \"Moved to backlog\"</td>\n<td>e.g., \"We can't do SSO this sprint because the API docs are outdated and the enterprise pipeline is 90 days out\"</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Task assignments</td>\n<td>Dependencies flagged during discussion</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Acceptance criteria</td>\n<td>Risk concerns engineers raised verbally</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
    },
    {
      "_key": "3b8f57d3bf9d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "38bb385a0d82",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Capturing the \"why\" behind story prioritization:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "31b3c4181029",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "9cc455a30007",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Granola's "
        },
        {
          "_key": "f96c204277c1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "90dc580dc313"
          ],
          "text": "AI-enhanced notes"
        },
        {
          "_key": "d19f9cff6417",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " capture the reasoning, trade-offs, and constraints behind each decision, not just a list of what was agreed. You can configure a "
        },
        {
          "_key": "15ab6cac3768",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "28b7f3ec8c13"
          ],
          "text": "sprint planning template"
        },
        {
          "_key": "87bbd2613f59",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " that directs the AI to surface estimates, blockers, dependencies, and deprioritization reasoning as distinct sections, so the output mirrors how your team thinks rather than how a generic summarizer categorizes meetings."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "90dc580dc313",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://help.granola.ai/article/ai-enhanced-notes"
        },
        {
          "_key": "28b7f3ec8c13",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://help.granola.ai/article/customise-notes-with-templates"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "570fdd8cfb1f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "83c5817d406a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Documenting deprioritization reasoning:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "3846bcf8ea11",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "6109c1d4c8d5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "When a feature moves to the backlog, the written record in Jira gets a status change. Granola captures the conversation that explains why. Weeks later, when a stakeholder asks \"why isn't this on the roadmap?\", you have a citation rather than a memory. As Granola's "
        },
        {
          "_key": "55a9265f0c1c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "dfce34a241da"
          ],
          "text": "product use case page"
        },
        {
          "_key": "aa1a836046c2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " describes: \"Send insights to Linear, Jira, Notion, or anywhere via Zapier to keep your roadmap up to date.\""
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "dfce34a241da",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.granola.ai/use-cases/product"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "34cfdc503982",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b991ec00876c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Creating a defensible source of truth:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "caab640bed39",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "117071360bba",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "When sprint planning incorporates customer research insights, the reasoning becomes traceable end-to-end. For example, Granola captures not just \"we're prioritizing mobile\" but \"three enterprise customers flagged mobile access in discovery calls last month.\" That link between research and execution makes your roadmap defensible to leadership without relying on memory."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a91c2b74edb9",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a9f742667286",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\"Granola nails exactly what I need: clean, reliable meeting transcripts and smart follow-up summaries without any fluff. I use it for nearly every call to stay focused on the conversation instead of scribbling notes.\" - "
        },
        {
          "_key": "7a465e8984fb",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "7dd5aa980694"
          ],
          "text": "Verified user on G2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "a7fdd054429c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "7dd5aa980694",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://g2.com/products/granola/reviews/granola-review-11289286"
        }
      ],
      "style": "blockquote"
    },
    {
      "_key": "fc1a90ad89eb",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "75c55c84ae90",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "How to use Granola for sprint planning"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "6b889364344b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "712b5d995ff2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Setup takes under five minutes. Here's how to run your first sprint planning session with full context capture."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "eb115aa0c273",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c369c871dc9f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Step 1: Connect your calendar and prepare your template"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "1073eb63457b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "4805f5a05279",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Download the Granola desktop app and connect your Google Workspace or Microsoft account. Granola syncs your calendar and detects upcoming meetings automatically. Before your sprint planning session, open "
        },
        {
          "_key": "821702299a2d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "b44ffd8c57fe"
          ],
          "text": "Granola's template settings"
        },
        {
          "_key": "721477d6e013",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " and configure a Sprint Planning template. A useful prompt includes:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "b44ffd8c57fe",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://docs.granola.ai/help-center/taking-notes/customise-notes-with-templates"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "137d01ed955a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "f18114186003",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Sprint goal and velocity review"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "1acf483f2cf3",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "113a021ee2c5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Backlog items discussed with story point reasoning"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e5b6100c86f8",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "7178e1739373",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Blockers and dependencies flagged"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "724c6dbe9dbb",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "4e7870410b2a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Items deprioritized and why"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e73725a3bf2b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "39db3cc76f77",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Decisions made with owners"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "46ec382082dd",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "9a54f4a32ec5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Granola's "
        },
        {
          "_key": "4eb03ffc6fac",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "8330330967c1"
          ],
          "text": "template documentation"
        },
        {
          "_key": "055dae9444f0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " covers how to save templates for recurring ceremonies so you don't rebuild context each sprint."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "8330330967c1",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.granola.ai/blog/upgraded-meeting-note-templates"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "b5a8148ccf2f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "cf77ff26bf56",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Step 2: Run the meeting as the facilitator, not the scribe"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "13790bd4a73d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "01484b9df329",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Granola sends a notification one minute before your scheduled meeting. Click to open the note and start transcribing. You can jot rough notes on the decisions that matter most to you. Those merge with the AI summary afterward via "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ecc7398ba1d5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "e95e38abfa63"
          ],
          "text": "AI-enhanced notes"
        },
        {
          "_key": "5e55f9bf76ec",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", so the output reflects your judgment, not a generic summary."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "e95e38abfa63",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://docs.granola.ai/help-center/taking-notes/ai-enhanced-notes"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "f512e6246b7f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "92cd9f2637d8",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Granola runs on your laptop or phone and uses your device's audio to generate notes in real time. Let participants know you're using Granola to transcribe the call, Granola's "
        },
        {
          "_key": "95869dfbd706",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "2fe3222d0e0f"
          ],
          "text": "in-meeting notice settings"
        },
        {
          "_key": "2c9bb9586f4a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " make this straightforward."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "2fe3222d0e0f",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://docs.granola.ai/help-center/consent-security-privacy/automatic-in-chat-entrance-messaging"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "8d46bec6a278",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "2cc2575ffc48",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "When you're not typing, you can push back on inflated estimates, ask the design question Engineering missed, and notice when the team is avoiding a difficult dependency. That facilitation quality changes the sprint, not just the notes."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "b557ef3d6fb1",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c02a7966a920",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Step 3: Review and enhance the output"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "2e810045cc9a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a7e7e4fa4b43",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "After the meeting ends, Granola generates enhanced notes that merge your typed context with the AI summary. Review the output and verify the deprioritization reasoning is captured accurately. If a specific trade-off was nuanced, say, the dependency was on a third-party timeline rather than internal capacity - add a clarifying sentence. The "
        },
        {
          "_key": "407de8934987",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "aa1a6e0a6a27"
          ],
          "text": "AI-enhanced notes workflow"
        },
        {
          "_key": "500ca8873d93",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " is designed for this human-in-the-loop refinement."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "aa1a6e0a6a27",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://help.granola.ai/article/ai-enhanced-notes"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "03c5646cf4e9",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "e75824cf0718",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Step 4: Sync the reasoning into Jira and Notion"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "9ed41c666695",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "77c9c4df09e6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Push sprint context to your tools:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "86ed4f467c6c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "39b7ea5479f7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Use the native "
        },
        {
          "_key": "746d7130df5c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "5a1fc75f863c"
          ],
          "text": "Notion integration"
        },
        {
          "_key": "d4501e853f0c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " to sync summaries to your planning doc"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "5a1fc75f863c",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://help.granola.ai/article/notion"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "f1552d9357c0",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "3d7ffbeff4a6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Connect via "
        },
        {
          "_key": "532ed3fddb45",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "2889b6d10a74"
          ],
          "text": "Zapier's Granola workflow"
        },
        {
          "_key": "cda4c161a5ce",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " for automated syncing to Jira or other tools"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "2889b6d10a74",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://zapier.com/apps/granola/integrations/notion"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "71320e30d0d6",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "8c5a87e9a1f3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Paste the \"Deprioritized Items & Reasoning\" section into relevant Jira ticket comments so context travels with the work item"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c1fc0ce2d40c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "17dbadd53ad5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "When someone opens that backlog ticket in six months, the reasoning is there. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ca4a4147c08d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "360c88872649"
          ],
          "text": "Zapier's overview of Granola workflows"
        },
        {
          "_key": "5a2ac78b941a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " describes how to automate sprint retrospective summaries directly into Notion, including context-specific suggestions for the next sprint."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "360c88872649",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://zapier.com/blog/granola-ai/"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "936aea72f3f1",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "35073429c0fb",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Using your repository for retrospective learning"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "5c654a044ff9",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b7f484bde5de",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The compounding value of Granola comes from querying across multiple sprints, not only the most recent one."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a2146a52bbe4",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "570cde213f3c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "4e06e30ed55a"
          ],
          "text": "Chatting with your meetings"
        },
        {
          "_key": "a3b664d2269e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " lets you ask questions across an entire folder of sprint notes: \"What engineering concerns have come up around the payment gateway over the last three sprints?\" or \"Which backlog items have been deprioritized more than twice?\" The system returns answers with citations to specific meeting transcripts."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "4e06e30ed55a",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://docs.granola.ai/help-center/getting-more-from-your-notes/chatting-with-your-meetings"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "5d1f6d750966",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "117fefca63af",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Recurring blockers that go unresolved surface as patterns rather than surprises. The conversation that deprecated a feature three sprints ago is retrievable in seconds, transforming retrospectives from memory exercises into pattern analysis."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e0e4fbb4588e",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "39f848323942",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The work your team chose not to do shapes your roadmap as much as the work you committed to. Granola captures that anti-roadmap, turning verbal trade-offs into a queryable record that survives team changes and stakeholder challenges."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0e8bf1cae994",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "55f5581534af",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "0e040ee5b8f4"
          ],
          "text": "Download"
        },
        {
          "_key": "8db95cafa731",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Granola for Mac, Windows, iPhone or Android, "
        },
        {
          "_key": "4af83ef17cb8",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "708efa48fcf1"
          ],
          "text": "connect your calendar"
        },
        {
          "_key": "efb1616581ee",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", and run your next sprint planning session to see the difference between a ticket and its context."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "0e040ee5b8f4",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.granola.ai/"
        },
        {
          "_key": "708efa48fcf1",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://docs.granola.ai/help-center/getting-started/syncing-your-calendars#syncing-your-calendars"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "353408a9e70f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "f868a1257df6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "FAQs about AI notepads for product teams"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "722ede608733",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b237a11f118f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Can Granola accurately capture technical jargon and team-specific terminology?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "ca05c6e594e5",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "caf37a5111d9",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Yes. You can add internal jargon and domain context to your template prompt before the meeting starts. The "
        },
        {
          "_key": "9be412bfd9b0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "81760f9b7f98"
          ],
          "text": "template customization guide"
        },
        {
          "_key": "97c79d253ac8",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " covers how to set meeting context that shapes the AI output."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "81760f9b7f98",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://docs.granola.ai/help-center/taking-notes/customise-notes-with-templates"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "4c34a3a9c5be",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b6d09ab1fa01",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Is Granola secure enough for internal roadmap discussions?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "6730abb93110",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "cace904cf66a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Granola is "
        },
        {
          "_key": "a00243004ac7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "7a3eaeeedccf"
          ],
          "text": "SOC 2 Type 2 certified"
        },
        {
          "_key": "2bd0a640b25b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " as of July 2025 and GDPR compliant. Per the "
        },
        {
          "_key": "dfeef6285875",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "2349656e4af0"
          ],
          "text": "Granola privacy policy"
        },
        {
          "_key": "da210f6f7235",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", it does not allow third parties like OpenAI or Anthropic to use your meeting data to train AI models, and Enterprise accounts get organization-wide AI training opt-out enforced by default."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "7a3eaeeedccf",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.granola.ai/updates/granola-is-soc2-type-2-compliant"
        },
        {
          "_key": "2349656e4af0",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://help.granola.ai/article/privacy-policy"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "44af9cf2838b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ae0f58011331",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "How does it handle estimation discussions where numbers change mid-conversation?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "3a157e984e16",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "3871033180bb",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Granola captures the full back-and-forth, not just the final number. For example, the transcript might record \"we moved from 3 to 5 points because of the dependency on the auth service\" alongside the final estimate, so the historical record is useful during retrospectives."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "19347870bd5c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "35783f64fb7e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "What are Granola's current limitations?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "79f200175d5c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "67272b4ea746",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A few constraints worth knowing before you commit:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "17a2fd7071eb",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "e29155b21363",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Granola does not offer audio playback, so you cannot replay a recording to verify exact phrasing after the fact."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "73290fd53b1d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "495686309cea",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Transcription accuracy is generally high in clean audio conditions but drops noticeably in noisy environments."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "1ab2b997b1fd",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "d996eb4e2af6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Speaker attribution is limited in large group calls where multiple participants speak in quick succession or voices are similar."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "67059c301b10",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "399004d8280f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Key terms glossary"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "3246b394227a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "200fcfbafb18",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Decision amnesia:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "43a1f36d2564",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " The loss of context around why a product decision was made, typically because the reasoning existed only as verbal discussion during a sprint ceremony and was never documented."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "f030af92cabd",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "e6035287ae7f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "AI notepad:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "d4fbb7c58e73",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " A tool that augments your note-taking by merging the rough notes you jot during meetings with AI-generated context from the transcript, rather than replacing your judgment with fully automated summaries."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "7a2709b76c54",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c8b058733e8b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Context rot:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "9c2aa2a7cbc4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " The degradation of sprint decision context over time, where a \"5-point estimate\" becomes impossible to explain months later because the verbal reasoning was never captured."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "380621cd5f0c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c47c9d736ed1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Folder-level query:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "c636fa4eaea5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " The ability to ask a question across an entire folder of meeting notes and receive an answer with source-linked citations from specific transcripts. See chatting with your meetings."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "1a0691d96c4e",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "e5c0f513829a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Deprioritization reasoning:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "c46d230cccdc",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " The documented explanation for why a backlog item was not selected for the current sprint - the most commonly lost context in product teams and the most valuable to recover during retrospectives."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    }
  ],
  "hidden": true,
  "isFeatured": false,
  "publishedAt": "2026-03-03",
  "slug": {
    "_type": "slug",
    "current": "sprint-planning-meetings-ai-notetakers-decisions-real-time"
  },
  "summary": "Sprint planning generates your most valuable product context, the verbal trade-offs, estimation debates, and deprioritization reasoning that never ends up in Jira. Granola runs on your laptop or phone and uses your device's audio to generate notes, so you can facilitate rather than scribe and query the reasoning months later when stakeholders ask \\\"why didn't we build X?\\\" and query the reasoning months later when stakeholders ask \\\"why didn't we build X?\\\"",
  "title": "Sprint planning meetings: Why AI notetakers matter when decisions are made real-time"
}